There was a suggestion that a shopping mall level should be added, so that
hackers would have the opportunnity to buy things early in the game, and
somebody else suggested that soldiers rather than keystone kops should
guard the level so that it wouldn't be too easy to steal.

I think it's a good idea, except that it would be too easy to come back
to the shops after you have a nice (shopkeeper-killing) weapon or a whole
lot of money and get all the powerful rings, wands, scrolls, and spells
that you would ever want.  What should happen is that the inventories of
these stores should slowly shrink - maybe other monsters would have the
opportunnity to purchase items, so that later in the game, they couldn't
be abused.

